// U5 slice 4d — the browser boot: turn the server-served shell into a running component. The page endpoint
// (Platform.Web/Endpoints/UiPageEndpoints) embedded a boot descriptor in <script id="osy-boot">; boot() reads it,
// obtains a Bearer token, opens a PlatformSession, fetches the component's wire tree, and mounts it into #app with
// the captured route params as props. Every dependency (document, fetch, token source, redirect) is injectable so
// the orchestration is unit-testable with fakes; index.ts wires the real browser globals.

